{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizza\u00efolo-Ninja</strong> is a <strong><i>'Die &amp; Retry'</i> platformer</strong> with :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ levels</strong> where everything can make you fall\u2014slippery platforms, electrified floors, pineapple cannons, and even pigeons (yes, it\u2019s weird).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>global speedrun leaderboard</strong> for those who love being at the top of the ladder!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every failure gets <strong>live commentary</strong> from the game\u2019s creator\u2014because suffering alone is just sad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Streamer Mode</strong> to play with your Twitch chat, featuring an interactive quiz that grants buffs (or debuffs) to spice up your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs with &quot;exceptional&quot; dialogue and lore (according to the writer\u2026 but we\u2019re not so sure).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easter eggs</strong> everywhere\u2014some are funny, others you just won\u2019t get\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a bunch of other stuff we forgot (but trust us, it\u2019s in there).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/09755c08ceab4c847bcfd6afb8c70f0d.poster.avif?t=1761680108\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/09755c08ceab4c847bcfd6afb8c70f0d.webm?t=1761680108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/09755c08ceab4c847bcfd6afb8c70f0d.mp4?t=1761680108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizza\u00efolo-Ninja</strong> is the only\u00a0 <i>'Die &amp; Retry'</i> platformer where you never actually die\u2026 but you take some spectacular falls! And of course, the higher you fall from, the more it hurts (your ego, mostly) and the saltier salty people will get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A simple but classic story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your uncle is being harassed by the henchmen of <strong>Bartony</strong>, a tyrant of industrial pizza who wants to buy his pizzeria and replace it with a vending machine dispensing\u2026 <i>pineapple pizza</i> (yes, that\u2019s a crime).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/dc87f10f12ee0d03f7fd62022e979f8c.avif?t=1761680108\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Tony Tribbiani</strong>, an Italian guy that's half-pizza\u00efolo, half-ninja (and 100% pissed off).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your mission?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb to the top of <strong>Bartony Tower</strong>, put an end to his reign of terror, and save pizza\u2019s honor before it\u2019s tainted by\u2026 pineapple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/d55b4d6e3f206be260d788f4677a5884.avif?t=1761680108\" width=1600 height=678 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your superpower?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a ninja\u2014on top of legendary flexibility, you\u2019ve got killer agility, a must-have for scaling the tower and dodging the many traps in your way! Or for falling\u2026 but in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/984f2b7569651a360dcca8a02bb67484.poster.avif?t=1761680108\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/984f2b7569651a360dcca8a02bb67484.webm?t=1761680108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/984f2b7569651a360dcca8a02bb67484.mp4?t=1761680108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to fall\u2026 but not to give up? Let\u2019s go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/32d1c95ab7dc577ac0a60e8c0be4f643.poster.avif?t=1761680108\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/32d1c95ab7dc577ac0a60e8c0be4f643.webm?t=1761680108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/32d1c95ab7dc577ac0a60e8c0be4f643.mp4?t=1761680108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2076150?t=1761680108","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/7ca0d03deac9a3a138a2947f4750b91f809b32a4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761680108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/52af886cddddcbcb566350e0b35c89e9a9289d31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761680108","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/52af886cddddcbcb566350e0b35c89e9a9289d31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761680108","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizza\u00efolo-Ninja</strong> is a <strong><i>'Die &amp; Retry'</i> platformer</strong> with :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ levels</strong> where everything can make you fall\u2014slippery platforms, electrified floors, pineapple cannons, and even pigeons (yes, it\u2019s weird).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>global speedrun leaderboard</strong> for those who love being at the top of the ladder!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every failure gets <strong>live commentary</strong> from the game\u2019s creator\u2014because suffering alone is just sad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Streamer Mode</strong> to play with your Twitch chat, featuring an interactive quiz that grants buffs (or debuffs) to spice up your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs with &quot;exceptional&quot; dialogue and lore (according to the writer\u2026 but we\u2019re not so sure).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easter eggs</strong> everywhere\u2014some are funny, others you just won\u2019t get\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a bunch of other stuff we forgot (but trust us, it\u2019s in there).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/09755c08ceab4c847bcfd6afb8c70f0d.poster.avif?t=1761680108\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/09755c08ceab4c847bcfd6afb8c70f0d.webm?t=1761680108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/09755c08ceab4c847bcfd6afb8c70f0d.mp4?t=1761680108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizza\u00efolo-Ninja</strong> is the only\u00a0 <i>'Die &amp; Retry'</i> platformer where you never actually die\u2026 but you take some spectacular falls! And of course, the higher you fall from, the more it hurts (your ego, mostly) and the saltier salty people will get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A simple but classic story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your uncle is being harassed by the henchmen of <strong>Bartony</strong>, a tyrant of industrial pizza who wants to buy his pizzeria and replace it with a vending machine dispensing\u2026 <i>pineapple pizza</i> (yes, that\u2019s a crime).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/dc87f10f12ee0d03f7fd62022e979f8c.avif?t=1761680108\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Tony Tribbiani</strong>, an Italian guy that's half-pizza\u00efolo, half-ninja (and 100% pissed off).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your mission?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb to the top of <strong>Bartony Tower</strong>, put an end to his reign of terror, and save pizza\u2019s honor before it\u2019s tainted by\u2026 pineapple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/d55b4d6e3f206be260d788f4677a5884.avif?t=1761680108\" width=1600 height=678 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your superpower?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a ninja\u2014on top of legendary flexibility, you\u2019ve got killer agility, a must-have for scaling the tower and dodging the many traps in your way! Or for falling\u2026 but in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/984f2b7569651a360dcca8a02bb67484.poster.avif?t=1761680108\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/984f2b7569651a360dcca8a02bb67484.webm?t=1761680108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/984f2b7569651a360dcca8a02bb67484.mp4?t=1761680108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to fall\u2026 but not to give up? Let\u2019s go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/32d1c95ab7dc577ac0a60e8c0be4f643.poster.avif?t=1761680108\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/32d1c95ab7dc577ac0a60e8c0be4f643.webm?t=1761680108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/extras/32d1c95ab7dc577ac0a60e8c0be4f643.mp4?t=1761680108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["WTJ Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076150/a34b32f6623461abf719bcb1f6d40fcae4229809/header.jpg?t=1761680108","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2076150/980118401/849985ff5ed3659522eba075c0a1bf0c8bd43563/1754428165/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761233726","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2076150/980118401/849985ff5ed3659522eba075c0a1bf0c8bd43563/1754428165/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761233726","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2076150/980118401/849985ff5ed3659522eba075c0a1bf0c8bd43563/1754428165/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761233726","id":257178757,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178757/movie480.mp4?t=1761233726","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178757/movie_max.mp4?t=1761233726"},"name":"Teaser Pizzaiolo-Ninja","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257178757/544ac9acd49941c386e4c7ba06db7e5517bfe3cc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761233726","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178757/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1761233726","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178757/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1761233726"}}],"name":"Pizza\u00efolo-Ninja","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recur